# SCENARIO: fix_115_density_backoff   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Fix #115 - a density-gated proximity wake backs off 5 s per bot instead of being re-asked every pass of
# the 300 ms Lua proximity monitor. Baseline B2 (runs/bl_b2r, same walk as below): 11119 `wake result=gated`
# records in 234 s from 70 bots (10947 on the prox path; busiest bot 529), census "wakeTried60s=1830
# wakeGated60s=1821 wakeGranted60s=9". The cap itself is by design and unchanged.
# Replaying bl_b2r's prox refusals through a 5 s per-bot backoff keeps 683 of 10947 (-93.8 %).
# Server truth: audit wake records (`watch *`) + census, which now carries wakeDeferred60s (calls answered
# from the backoff, NOT counted as tried/gated/granted); [PROXIMITY] gains "deferred=".
# PRECONDITION: normal AI, one harness player (p1), 500 bots, density cap on (production config).
# Acceptance (single run): <= 2500 gated wake records over the walk (baseline 11119); >= 1 ok wake
# (the realism side must not regress: baseline 62); >= 1 census record with wakeDeferred60s > 0.
# Offline replay: python tools/bottest/replay.py <this> runs/bl_b2r -> the gated-volume check FAILS
# (11119) and the wakeDeferred60s check FAILS (field absent).
@srv audit kinds wake,hib,state,census,cmd
@srv audit watch *
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv audit mark "F115 start"
@p1 login
@p1 perceive reset=1
@p1 goto 32369,32232,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
# (32352,32221,7) is a teleporter to 32251,32205,11 - approach the depot from the y=32215 street
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32351,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32347,32218,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 hold 30
@p1 goto 32351,32215,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 goto 32369,32193,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 goto 32369,32183,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 hold 30
@p1 goto 32369,32170,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=120 optional=1
@p1 hold 30
@p1 goto 32369,32203,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 goto 32369,32233,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 hold 30
@p1 perceive
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=wake result=gated min=0 max=2500 within=1200
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=census wakeDeferred60s~="^[1-9]" min=1 within=1200
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=wake result=ok min=1 within=1200
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=census min=5 within=1200
@srv audit mark "F115 end"
@srv audit watch clear
@srv audit off
@p1 logout
